  "source_sha256": "156c244ed856bcd67d36282d990130d82916a9713a42f0351107216a2c144a0f",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8e365b4f5133080a949b509b3a9100a3eb22d6bcee89b879d650e769bffd4ae9",
      "text": "Wukong’s\nWibble-Wobble\nRide",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e8652f595671b76d31252d020faf883306183636215e3dd7d0b8d9842071fc6c",
      "text": "“Look at them go!”\nWukong’s tail went BOING!\n“I want to ride, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6a8f69564345688664399850b48f25a64d0db986ef5a3aa3c84ca8ecc59392d6",
      "text": "Wukong put on his helmet.\n“Ready!”\n“Um… it’s backward!”\nWukong giggled.\n“Let’s try again!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "43e3067a925d82b5f53ed52a68cf99e790ff293a9f6f25cee2f8400b0dd3e2a0",
      "text": "He pushed with his feet.\nScoot. Scoot. Scoot.\n“Look! My bike is a scooter!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e30b752b5d97ede8e2918855ecfddadc2cedf59e82308b72f6adb3d3933223c5",
      "text": "Feet up…\nWibble! Wobble!\nPLOP!\n“Hello, grass.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "755f2628451b56a95727c1a15a9626aae7901246cc2cca3e447827748882e616",
      "text": "“Maybe the bell will help.”\nDing! Ding!\nThe bell rang.\nHe still wobbled.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0773441a0655bc96ec122e51aa8af1766b578c5d49a4db85a61dde334a00b9c2",
      "text": "Pigsy held the seat.\n“Eyes ahead. Nice and slow.”\nJade cheered.\n“You can do it!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "31bc3dea7d751cd66119101f84741ae4e5e3fa371c181c67de679d4129ae4616",
      "text": "Wukong tried again.\nHe pushed one pedal.\nThen the other.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "08675accc56864433ebf62d1fdfd7af668a73827ebd7b587ab17d91e9172f12f",
      "text": "He wobbled left.\nHis tail wobbled right.\n“My tail is learning, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c49686dc37381cbd623ad0680375ecd0877318acc508d79747570e6537182578",
      "text": "He tried a little every day.\nSome rides were short.\nSome were wobbly.\nHe kept trying.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "72ca01e1b765b10bd6f0fb91201455c63d3f3acd37cf640a3954d9875689d3a7",
      "text": "Then, one evening…\nPigsy let go.\nWukong kept going!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "287fb52d7c714977cb980fa0a773755ed8e368cdc37226216c468c6763d1ee6f",
      "text": "“I’m doing it!”\nHis scarf waved behind him.\nHis tail made a loop.\nHe felt so proud!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "adf0ccebf8a008fd126bccc1db6ebc4dc656a5b0a58fd701f6e3b41006cb67ad",
      "text": "He learned to turn.\nHe learned to stop.\nHe stopped before a puddle.\n“After you, little duck.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "73046cd499c7db71abf5f1a404a34e56b43da8998d6a40e45ac79e5bff8611c0",
      "text": "Now they rode together.\nNo rush.\nJust happy wheels.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d47bb00d1f74c88b4151ec7a5d3aec8003378a24ca322f5201c785016de95620",
      "text": "At home, he parked his bike.\n“Goodnight, wheels.”\n“Goodnight, wobbles.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d1fcd356fbbe10eb1cacced7220d7bf74e818b7c1ffb36db4b29d771fe527e70",
      "text": "Wukong curled up in bed.\nIn his dreams,\nthe path was smooth.\nAnd the wheels whispered,\n“Shhh…”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
